  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Clock Tower is a building that can be repaired at Builder Hall Level 4. When activated, the Clock Tower will make timers in the Builder Base speed ten times as fast as normal for a short duration. This duration can be increased by upgrading the Clock Tower.",
    "If the Clock Tower is not active, it can also be activated using Gems. A Clock Tower Potion can also be used to boost the Clock Tower for 30 minutes at any time (this duration is independent of Clock Tower level, and the potion works regardless of whether the Clock Tower is active)."
  ],
